        "subject": "LU-16518 sec: remove unused sptlrpc helper functions",
        "message": "LU-16518 sec: remove unused sptlrpc helper functions\n\n... since they are no longer used. The last callers of\nsptlrpc_cli_ctx_display() and sptlrpc_cli_install_rvs_ctx()\nwere removed a long time ago. gss_u32_write(), __dbg_memdump(),\nsptlrpc_rule_set_dump() and sptlrpc_import_flush_root_ctx()\nnever had any callers since they were introduced.\n\nFixes: 9b73c02192b3 (\"branch: HEAD land b1_8_gssfix (20070919_1543): various gss fixes (b11841)\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ia624603ec6e7263d98d7930ab4045f9cb19a778b\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/67271\nReviewed-by: Sebastien Buisson <sbuisson@ddn.com>\nReviewed-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\n"
